  partName: High Pressure Turbine Blade
  description: The High Pressure Turbine Blade is a key component of the high-pressure
    turbine, responsible for extracting energy from the hot gases produced by combustion.
    Its unique shape and material properties allow it to withstand the extreme conditions
    and efficiently transfer energy to the turbine shaft. One notable detail is that
    the blade's aerodynamic design helps to minimize energy losses and maximize power
    output.
